# Business Requirements Document (BRD)

## Project Name

Digital Lending Credit Risk Analysis & Loan Portfolio Dashboard

## Document Purpose

This document defines the business requirements for analyzing digital lending data to identify customer risk factors, loan default patterns, and portfolio performance.

The objective is to provide business teams with data-driven insights that improve lending decisions and reduce credit risk.

---

# 1. Business Background

Digital lending platforms process thousands of loan applications. Increasing loan defaults can negatively impact profitability, cash flow, and overall portfolio health.

The lending organization requires an analytical solution to understand borrower behavior, identify high-risk segments, and monitor loan performance.

---

# 2. Business Objective

The primary objectives of this project are:

* Analyze historical loan application data
* Identify factors contributing to loan defaults
* Segment customers based on risk levels
* Monitor loan portfolio performance
* Create dashboards for business decision-making

---

# 3. Business Goals

| Goal                      | Description                                           |
| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Reduce Credit Risk        | Identify customers with higher probability of default |
| Improve Lending Decisions | Support better approval strategies                    |
| Monitor Portfolio Health  | Track loan performance metrics                        |
| Identify Risk Segments    | Analyze customer and loan characteristics             |

